    "message": "round8 gate: default reclaim depth 6, so make round8-heavy reproduces the published word\n\nbuild_word.py defaulted DEEP to 12 while complex_hist.py, which reproduces the published histogram, uses depth 6, so the last step of make round8-heavy failed on a clean checkout. Default 6 matches the docstring; DEEP=12 in the environment still selects the deeper reclaim. The published certificate is unaffected. Found and fixed by RobGruhl.",
